      <title>A Quine in Odin</title>
      <link>/article/2019/03/10/quine-in-odin/</link>
      <pubDate>Sun, 10 Mar 2019 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      
      <guid>/article/2019/03/10/quine-in-odin/</guid>
      <description><p>A <a href="https://wikipedia.org/wiki/Quine_(computing)">Quine</a> in <a href="/odin">Odin</a>:</p>
<pre><code class="language-odin">package quine

import &quot;core:fmt&quot;

main :: proc() {
	fmt.printf(&quot;%s%c%s%c;\n&quot;, s, 0x60, s, 0x60);
}

s := `package quine

import &quot;core:fmt&quot;

main :: proc() {
	fmt.printf(&quot;%s%c%s%c;\n&quot;, s, 0x60, s, 0x60);
}

s := `;
</code></pre>
</description>
